OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FWatch Kris Jepson's report on the
OL,8,FKane's World Foundation awareness
OL,9,Ftraining in Darlington's Cornmill
OL,10,FShopping Centre.
OL,12,FThe mother of a boy with autism has
OL,13,Fdelivered awareness training sessions
OL,14,Fto staff at 25 businesses and
OL,15,Forganisations in Darlington to ensure
OL,16,Fthey are more "kind" and
OL,17,F"understanding" to families with
OL,18,Fchildren who have special educational
OL,19,Fneeds and disabilities (SEND).
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FKelly Knight set up Kane's World
OL,8,FFoundation in 2025, named after her
OL,9,Fseven-year-old son, Kane, who is non-
OL,10,Fverbal and presents as a three-year-
OL,11,Fold due to autism. The charity offers
OL,12,Fsupport to SEND children and their
OL,13,Ffamilies through activities and
OL,14,Fsupport groups.
OL,16,FKelly offers basic awareness training
OL,17,Fthat help businesses and food
OL,18,Festablishments better understand SEND
OL,19,Fchildren and how they can be a more
OL,20,Fwelcoming space for families like hers.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FKelly bases the training on past
OL,8,Fnegative experiences with Kane, when
OL,9,Forganisations have not fully
OL,10,Funderstood how he can struggle to
OL,11,Fregulate his emotions in certain
OL,12,Fenvironments. Kelly explained:
OL,14,F"In an environment that was crowded he
OL,15,Fgets extremely overwhelmed and his
OL,16,Fresponse to that would be fight, where
OL,17,FI would get kicked, punched, hair
OL,18,Fpulled.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,F"It goes from nought to fifty really,
OL,8,Freally quickly, and that could be
OL,9,Fperceived by somebody who doesn't have
OL,10,Fthat understanding that he's just a
OL,11,Fnaughty child."
OL,13,FKelly hopes the workshops can help
OL,14,Ftackle the negative reactions her
OL,15,Ffamily have experienced.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FShe added: "You get the tuts, you get
OL,8,Fthe stares, you can hear the whispers,
OL,9,Fand we're not in a position to respond
OL,10,Fto everything, because we're trying to
OL,11,Fmanage and keep our children safe in
OL,12,Fthat moment."
OL,14,FThe training sessions advocate for
OL,15,Fquiet spaces, planned quiet times, and
OL,16,Ffidget friends bags, which contain
OL,17,Fsensory toys that help soothe and
OL,18,Fregulate the children.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
