OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FAttending one workshop at the Cornmill
OL,8,FShopping Centre in Darlington,
OL,9,FSeineade Stainsby, who runs a health
OL,10,Fand beauty shop, said: "It was really
OL,11,Finformative. Kelly's really given me a
OL,12,Flot of knowledge on what I can do in
OL,13,Fmy shop to help just alleviate any
OL,14,Fproblems that they have with the
OL,15,Fchildren."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
