OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FThe chairman of Darling RFC, Andrew
OL,8,FGunnell, also attended and although
OL,9,Fhis sports club provides different
OL,10,Fchallenges, he did see some beneficial
OL,11,Fchanges that could be made to welcome
OL,12,FSEND families more.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FHe added: "It's a completely different
OL,8,Fconcept to do it on a grass pitch,
OL,9,Fwith a team, than it is one family,
OL,10,Fshopping in a store, but there's
OL,11,Fthings that we've already spoken to
OL,12,FKelly about how we can take her ideas,
OL,13,Ftwist them, adapt them, develop them,
OL,14,Fand make them work for us in that
OL,15,Fsports environment."
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/10
