OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FMany SEND families avoid going out for
OL,8,Ffood and meals due to challenges,
OL,9,Fwhich can easily be overcome with
OL,10,Funderstanding, tools and suggestions
OL,11,Fthe charity says it can offer to make
OL,12,Ffood environments more inclusive.
OL,14,FAlex Blackham has already incorporated
OL,15,Fthe skills and awareness from the
OL,16,Ftraining in his cafe and said the
OL,17,Ffidget friends bag with sensory toys
OL,18,Fhas had a real positive impact on SEND
OL,19,Fchildren who have visited his cafe.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786465168
OL,3,CAwareness training for businesses
OL,4,Cencouraging 'kindness' for SEND
OL,5,Cfamilies
OL,7,FHe said: "(in the past we may have
OL,8,Fbeen) thinking it's a naughty child or
OL,9,Fthinking it's a very bad parent, (but)
OL,10,Fnow we can learn to recognise that we
OL,11,Fmaybe shouldn't be making those
OL,12,Fdecisions."
OL,14,FKelly plans to expand Kane's World
OL,15,FFoundation, providing activities,
OL,16,Fevents and days out for SEND children
OL,17,Fand their families.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G10/10
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
